Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来庆祝光明节\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we have fun celebrating Hanukkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有圣诞老公公\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不乖吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was I bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  你没有不乖  你今年很乖  班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no, you weren't bad. You've been very good, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公生我的气  不是  嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Santa's mad at me. No, hey, hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班  圣诞老公公没有生你的气  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ben, Santa is not mad at you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是他最喜欢的小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're his favorite little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以圣诞老公公会来嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Santa's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.39,0:06:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公会来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Santa's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很简单   保持轻松\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's easy. Just keep it casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说句好话  和他握手  塞钱给他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give him a kind word, Shake his hand and give him the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么这么了解   我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you know so much about this? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查以前常这么做   是不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard used to do it, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在可能已经在喝汤了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'd be eating our soup right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的小胡子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mustached bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人刚走  快  给他钱拿座位号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, those people just left. Come on. Quick, give him the money and get their table!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们赶时间   可不可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're in a bit of a hurry. Can we please...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢鼓啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you like the drums.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来还担心它们会造成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, I was worried that they would create maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们之间无法忍受的居住状况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...an unbearable living situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  看来没有  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, okay, well, apparently not. So, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们学会了一首歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs, check it out, we already learned a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了1  2  3  4\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready? One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塔奇拉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tequila!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  阿甘  放在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, Gunther. Put her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用铜板就没有那么容易了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Definitely not easier with coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你  现在我只欠你49块半了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here. Now I only owe you $49.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要送乔伊毁掉整栋楼的圣诞礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you want to get Joey a Christmas present that disrupts the entire building...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,何不送更微妙一点的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...why not something a little bit more subtle...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.68,0:08:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是铁锤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...like a wrecking ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是把天花病毒散播在走廊上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or a vial of smallpox to release in the hallway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:09:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只是鼓的声音  每5分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not just the drum noise. Every five minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊把鼓棒丢到空中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Joey throws his sticks in the air...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就会听到  "喔  我的眼睛  天哪  我的眼睛"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I have to hear: "Oh, my eye! Oh, God, my eye!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烦死人了  对  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it's so annoying. Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  这是正常人对鼓的反应\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You see, this is how normal people are supposed to react to drums.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你送乔伊鼓是为了烦瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, You got Joey drums to annoy Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好让她不想继续住在那里吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so she wouldn't want to live there anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能有一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe on some level.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.35,0:09:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你知道你不用丢鼓棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, y'know that you could just not throw the sticks up in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样怎么能算是玩摇滚乐呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is rock 'n' roll about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  乔伊  送你另外一个礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey, I got you another present.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下   先不要告诉我是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay wait, Before you tell me what it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.41,0:09:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.03,0:09:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一只\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毒蜘蛛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...tarantula!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.33,0:10:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  瑞秋  抱歉  我在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, Rachel, look, I'm sorry. What was I thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送乔伊这么一个   恶心的  可怕的蜘蛛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...giving Joey this big, gross, scary spider...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还用这么一个松散的笼子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in such a poorly constructed cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊   我喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about? I love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.43,0:10:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候就有一只   后来我的猫咪吃掉了它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had a tarantula when I was a kid. But it-it died, because my cat ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.77,0:10:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后猫咪也死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then my cat died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  这不是很酷吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, Joey, isn't this cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我身上吗  我觉得他在我身上  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it on me? I feel like it's on me. I got--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是很可爱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, isn't that adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊怕蜘殊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey is afraid of the tarantula. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.79,0:10:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他好可爱哟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, yeah, He's so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天  他很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊是最棒的  很高兴你在这里住得很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey is the best, I'm glad you're having so much fun here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.63,0:10:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Wait-wait a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的房子好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our apartment is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.34,0:10:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不高兴是因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that makes you angry because...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.59,0:10:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你很想和乔伊住在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you'd rather live here with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么想呢   摩妮卡和钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where did you get that? Monica and Chandler...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.31,0:11:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说你和乔伊住得很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...said you were having so much fun here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且不管是鼓还是毒蜘殊   都不会改变这点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and apparently no amount of drums or tarantulas is gonna change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.48,0:11:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你送乔伊这些东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe? Did you get all this stuff for Joey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.99,0:11:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是想让我不住这里吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to try to drive me out of the apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  那你还不如送他一条鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, if you wanted to do that, you might as well just gotten him a fish,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我有多怕鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how fish freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.21,0:11:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都不重要  菲比  我们会住一起的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It wouldn't have mattered anyway, Phoebe, you and I are, are gonna live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是室友  讲好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're roommates, that's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  可是我希望你想和我一起住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but I wanted you to want to live with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是  如果你在这里住得这么开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But okay, if you're having so much fun over here--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  和你在一起更开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. It's so much more fun with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们住一起时很开心  对不对  对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We did have fun, didn't we? We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好玩的不得了  他们说如果我们想的话  今晚可以去看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, anyway, they say if we want, we could see it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I would love to. Yay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good, good, good. Great. All right. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡要我让鼓声停止\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Monica asked me to make the drumming stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（万圣节探险  面具大师）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  先生  要退还那件裤子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, sir. You here to return those pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   这是我的裤子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, these are my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要什么   还有没有圣诞老公公衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can I help you? Um, do you have a Santa outfit left?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞节前两天   抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two days before Christmas? Sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.19,0:12:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  有没有什么算是比较圣诞节的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look. Do you have anything, uh, Christmas-y?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我答应了儿子   不想让他失望\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I promised my son, and I really don't want to disappoint him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托   你们一定有什么吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, come on, I…uh, you gotta have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是佳节犰狳（哺乳动物）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm the Holiday Armadillo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是圣诞老公公的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a friend of Santa's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要我来祝你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and he sent me here to wish you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公怎么了  佳节犰狳（哺乳动物）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened to Santa, Holiday Armadillo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.59,0:12:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公没有空\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Santa was unavailable...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.22,0:13:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这么接近圣诞节的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so close to Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请进   请坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come in, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定累坏了吧   大老远从德州跑来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You must be exhausted, coming all the way from Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德州  对   班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Texas? That's right, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是圣诞老公公的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Santa's representative...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西南州代表\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...for all the Southern states.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有墨西哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Mexico!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公要我来这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But Santa sent me here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送礼物给你   班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to give you these presents, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这位小姐可以帮我拿礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe the lady will help me with these presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气   班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're welcome, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Merry Christmas. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有光明节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And happy Hanukkah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也为光明节而来吗   因为我是一半犹太人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you for Hanukkah too? Because I'm part Jewish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are? Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为犰狳（哺乳动物）是在沙漠里晃荡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because armadillos also wandered in the desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想在走廊里晃荡吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to wander in the hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Hey, Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,何不让节日犰狳（哺乳动物）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if the Holiday Armadillo...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说光之节的故事好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...told you all about the Festival of Lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧   班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多年以前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Years and years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一群人  叫做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...there were these people called...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛加伯人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the Maccabees!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呵呵呵  圣诞快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ho-ho-ho. Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.87,0:14:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么   圣诞老公公\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here, Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.21,0:14:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来看我的老朋友班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm here to see my old buddy, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:15:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪乌龟人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Weird Turtle Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是节日犰狳（哺乳动物）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm the Holiday Armadillo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的半个犹太人朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...your part-Jewish friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我来送礼物给班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sent me here to give Ben some presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公   你有带礼物给我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you bring me any presents, Santa'?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有  班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You bet I did, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Put her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是他的手太小   这次会成功的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it would have worked this time if his hands weren't so damn small.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呵呵呵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ho-ho-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班  来开礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ben, why don't you come open more presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公   节日犰狳和我要在厨房里谈一谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Santa, the armadillo and I have a little talk in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.89,0:15:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对想不到会说出这句话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a sentence I never thought I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉每个人说   你找不到圣诞老公公衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You called everyone and said you were having trouble finding a Santa costume...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我向同事借了一件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I borrowed one from a guy at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.11,0:16:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  可是你必须离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, but you gotta leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我终于让他对光明节有兴趣了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm finally getting him excited about Hanukkah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你却正在破坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you're wrecking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我还没摇摇我的肚子呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I didn't get to shake my belly like a bowlful of jelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉   钱德   这对我很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, Chandler but this, but this is really important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好   我去还了这套衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine, I'll give the suit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.93,0:16:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   你可以再多借一晚上吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you think you can keep it another night?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.93,0:16:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公  真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Santa, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊   可以吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸有扮过圣诞老公公吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did your dad ever dress up like Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有   那就可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Then it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班  圣诞老公公要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Ben. Santa has to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要   他为什么要走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, why does he have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为圣诞老公公和节日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because if Santa and the Holiday...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,犰狳（哺乳动物）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Armadillo...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果在同一个房子里待太久的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...are ever in the same room for too long...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙就会爆炸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the universe will implode!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.10,0:17:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  为什么不是犰狳走呢  我要圣诞老公公\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, why can't the armadillo leave? I want Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我放弃  圣诞老公公\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine, I give up. Santa--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞老公公可以留下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Santa can stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我留下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'll stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.99,0:17:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我想听光明节的故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but only because I want to hear about Hanukkah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班   你要不要和圣诞老公公\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ben, will you sit here with Santa...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一起坐下来听光明节的故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and learn about Hanukkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  圣诞老人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  来听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, it's time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光明节的故事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...for the story of Hanukkah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.51,0:17:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多年以前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Years and years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一群人叫玛加伯人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...there were these people called the Maccabees!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  看看这地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wow, look at this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们改了很多地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They've made so many changes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我感受不到我祖母的存在了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I can't even feel my grandmother's presence anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.37,0:18:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   新的烛台\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, new sconces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得你告诉我   你祖母要做一道墙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, remember uh, remember how you told me your grandmother put up that wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来隔成两间房   对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to make that into two bedrooms? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说怕房东可能会发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And remember how you always said you were afraid the landlord might find out...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把它拆了  对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then tear it down? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不知道我说这些的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you really not know where I'm going with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,墙没有了  是一间大房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It left. It's one huge room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.78,0:18:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须要把墙弄回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I guess we'll have to put the wall back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.66,0:18:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  因为新的天窗   有天窗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't because of the new skylight. There's a skylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:18:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办   要开始找新地方吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. So what should we do? Should we start looking for a new place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗   我感受到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I'm sensing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我祖母可能不喜欢那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that, urn, my grandmother would not be comfortable with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又能感觉到她了  是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Starting to feel her again there, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点  对  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A little bit. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.19,0:19:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你祖母是不是说  你应该一个人住这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs is your grandmother maybe saying that you should live here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也听见了   你真有天分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You heard it too? You have the gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.99,0:19:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢和乔伊住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like living with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗   拜托   我讨厌打包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure? Please. I hate packing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里离公司比较近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it's closer to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.83,0:19:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在一起很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we do have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我真的会想念和你住在一起的日子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Although, I'm really gonna miss living with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.67,0:19:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, me too. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下   你有没有听到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. wait did you hear that-hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听  我听到你祖母在说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I'm getting something from your grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说既然你要一个人住这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She said since you get to keep the one-bedroom apartment...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该把那把紫色椅子给瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you should give Rachel the purple chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我没有听到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I do not hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇迹在于那一点点的油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the miracle was that that little bit of oil...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该只够烧一天的  却烧了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that should have lasted just one day, burned for...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整整8天  对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eight whole days. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么我们  今天庆祝光明节   故事完结\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's why we celebrate Hanukkah today. The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Awesome. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢的部分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My favorite part...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是超人救出全埃及的犹太人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...was when Superman flew all the Jews out of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.09,0:20:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,犰狳（哺乳动物）不是那么喜欢那部分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The armadillo was actually not so thrilled about that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好   班   该来点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Ben, it's time to light...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.31,0:20:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光明节蜡烛了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the Hanukkah candles!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.49,0:20:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.03,0:20:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是复活节兔子的葬礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like the Easter Bunny's funeral in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  来  我们要点蜡烛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, come on. We're lighting the candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.12,0:21:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  啊哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我了解为什么超人在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I understand why Superman is here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但为什么有豪猪参加复活节兔子的葬礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but why is there a porcupine at the Easter Bunny's funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你弄好了吗   弄好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You get it? I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他进笼子了没\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Back in the cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在笼子里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's back in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笼子关好了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}ls the cage closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  出来好吗  别像个小孩一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, will you just come out here and stop being such a baby?
